  <Properties>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[The message? "Knowing git halfway isn’t great; I’ll find myself causing havoc. Mastering git is useful and not super-hard. I should learn more about and practice git."

This interactive session will include a git internals lecture in which you'll understand the fundamental design principles and implementation choices behind git, and then a Capture-The-Flag challenge that revolves around git. You'll advance in the challenge by using git commands to get the flag that unlocks the next stage.]]></Value>
